sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as MEDITECH
  participant G as HL7 Edge Gateway
  participant T as topic lab-results
  participant S as subscriptions
  participant Q as queue orders-inbound
  participant P as Care portal
  M->>G: ORU^R01 RES-4001 (MLLP :7890)
  G-->>M: ACK AA (stored)
  G->>T: send, MessageId RES-4001
  T->>S: copy to analytics and archive
  P->>Q: order ORD-5001
  G->>Q: receive (peek-lock)
  Q-->>G: ORD-5001
  G->>G: store
  G->>Q: complete
  G->>M: ORD-5001 (MLLP :6661)
  M-->>G: ACK AA
  Note over M: MEDITECH down
  P->>Q: order ORD-5002
  G->>Q: receive, store, complete
  G->>M: ORD-5002
  M--xG: no connection
  Note over G: ORD-5002 waits in the gateway's queue
  G->>M: ORD-5002 (retry, MEDITECH back)
  M-->>G: ACK AA
